# www.evolako.rs static build (site/build.py output) — never committed; local state of `wrangler pages dev` in site/
site/dist/
site/.wrangler/
site/tools/fake_bot/.wrangler/
# ...but a "dist" folder inside the site snapshot mirror is a CDN path (cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.15/dist/),
# not build output: the rule "dist/" above made the snapshot commit lose the GSAP files
!site/snapshot/**/dist/
!site/snapshot-fill/**/dist/
